          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno gwokere win, kole wikineno cal pere munyo Rwoth oluwo gi win i Horeb i dier mac; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 26:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋey wikiri witim gir'amien gi timo cal, i nger moro je, ma jacwo kosa madhako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cal mar'ogwaŋ moro je i piny, kosa ma winyo maay i koyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cal ma gimoro je ma yware gi kore i lowo, cal ma rec ma pi i pendi piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosa ka witiŋo waŋ win malo i polo to wineno waŋceŋ, dwe, kodi micalin, kodi lwak ma i polo, wikiri wirweny to wikule piny rijo kodi tiyo rijo, gigipiny ma Rwoth Were mewin omiyo nonin je manitie i pendi polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
